"Roots Foundation collaborates with Acuity Group to expand digital classrooms in Maharashtra.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"280px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"p-3 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-roots-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1\">June 18, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] font-bold text-roots-text leading-snug mb-1.5 line-clamp-3 group-hover:text-roots-primary transition-colors\">Roots Foundation collaborates with Acuity Group to expand digital classrooms in Maharashtra.</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] text-roots-text/85 line-clamp-3 leading-normal\">By integrating interactive smart boards and providing regular teacher training, the initiative aims to bridge the digital divide in rural communities.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-roots-primary mt-2\"><span>Read Full Story</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a><a class=\"flex-shrink-0 snap-start block\" href=\"/news/article/2\"><div class=\"w-[280px] h-[390px] bg-white border border-gray-200/85 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between text-left transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50/30 border-b border-gray-100 h-[48px] flex items-center\"><span class=\" text-gray-900 font-serif font-black tracking-widest text-xs uppercase\">THE TIMES OF INDIA</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-[150px] bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100\"><img alt=\"Ground Report: How organic farming is reviving soil health in 500+ Rajasthan villages.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"280px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"p-3 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-roots-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1\">May 24, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] font-bold text-roots-text leading-snug mb-1.5 line-clamp-3 group-hover:text-roots-primary transition-colors\">Ground Report: How organic farming is reviving soil health in 500+ Rajasthan villages.</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] text-roots-text/85 line-clamp-3 leading-normal\">Farmers report a significant drop in chemical input costs and a steady rise in crop yields after adopting modern organic techniques.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-roots-primary mt-2\"><span>Read Full Story</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a><a class=\"flex-shrink-0 snap-start block\" href=\"/news/article/3\"><div class=\"w-[280px] h-[390px] bg-white border border-gray-200/85 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between text-left transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50/30 border-b border-gray-100 h-[48px] flex items-center\"><span class=\"bg-green-50/50 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-green-200/30 text-[#75bc20] font-black tracking-normal text-base font-sans\">NGOBOX</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-[150px] bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100\"><img alt=\"Roots Foundation receives regional award for excellence in vocational skill training for women.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"280px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-5.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"p-3 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-roots-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1\">April 12, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] font-bold text-roots-text leading-snug mb-1.5 line-clamp-3 group-hover:text-roots-primary transition-colors\">Roots Foundation receives regional award for excellence in vocational skill training for women.</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] text-roots-text/85 line-clamp-3 leading-normal\">Over 200 women graduated from tailoring and craftsmanship programs, with direct linkages to local market selling networks.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-roots-primary mt-2\"><span>Read Full Story</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a><a class=\"flex-shrink-0 snap-start block\" href=\"/news/article/4\"><div class=\"w-[280px] h-[390px] bg-white border border-gray-200/85 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between text-left transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50/30 border-b border-gray-100 h-[48px] flex items-center\"><span class=\" text-[#ef7f3a] font-bold text-sm\">दैनिक जागरण / DAINIK JAGRAN</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-[150px] bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100\"><img alt=\"खेलों से संवर रहा ग्रामीण बच्चों का भविष्य: स्पोर्ट्स लैब पहल की नई उड़ान\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"280px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg3.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"p-3 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-roots-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1\">March 05, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] font-bold text-roots-text leading-snug mb-1.5 line-clamp-3 group-hover:text-roots-primary transition-colors\">खेलों से संवर रहा ग्रामीण बच्चों का भविष्य: स्पोर्ट्स लैब पहल की नई उड़ान</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] text-roots-text/85 line-clamp-3 leading-normal\">स्कूली बच्चों को खेल सामग्री और पेशेवर कोचिंग देकर उनमें शारीरिक साक्षरता और खेल भावना को बढ़ावा दिया जा रहा है।</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-roots-primary mt-2\"><span>Read Full Story</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a><a class=\"flex-shrink-0 snap-start block\" href=\"/news/article/5\"><div class=\"w-[280px] h-[390px] bg-white border border-gray-200/85 shadow-md hover:shadow-xl rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between text-left transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1.5\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50/30 border-b border-gray-100 h-[48px] flex items-center\"><span class=\" text-gray-800 font-serif italic font-bold tracking-tight text-sm\">THE FINANCIAL EXPRESS</span></div><div class=\"relative w-full h-[150px] bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100\"><img alt=\"Corporate Partnerships: Driving sustainable rural development through accountability.\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"280px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=16&amp;q=75 16w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fstorychange%2Fimg1.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"p-3 flex-1 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><span class=\"text-[10px] text-roots-primary font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-1\">February 15, 2026</span><h3 class=\"text-[12px] sm:text-[13px] font-bold text-roots-text leading-snug mb-1.5 line-clamp-3 group-hover:text-roots-primary transition-colors\">Corporate Partnerships: Driving sustainable rural development through accountability.</h3><p class=\"text-[11px] text-roots-text/85 line-clamp-3 leading-normal\">A study on the CSR initiatives executed by Roots Foundation shows high retention rates in schools and better income stability for farmers.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-bold text-roots-primary mt-2\"><span>Read Full Story</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-3 h-3 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div></div></div></a></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-left\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-roots-text font-sans\">Gallery</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-roots-text/70 mt-1\">A visual glimpse into our work and impact</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-12 gap-4\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-3 relative h-[220px] rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-200/50 shadow-sm group cursor-pointer\"><img alt=\"Agriculture program crop monitoring\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(max-w-768px) 100vw, 30vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fimg-1.jpg&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 3