m text-[#4A4749] mb-3 leading-snug\">Sign up to recieve newsletter</p><div class=\"flex border border-[#09569a] rounded overflow-hidden\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter Your Mail\" class=\"flex-1 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-[#4A4749] bg-white outline-none placeholder-gray-400\" value=\"\"/><button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-[#09569a] text-white text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">Submit</button></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[#4A4749] mt-3 leading-relaxed\">By subscribing, you agree to our Privacy Policy and consent to receive updates from us.</p></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5 text-[#09569a] mt-0.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><p class=\"text-xs text-[#4A4749] leading-relaxed\">UNITECH BUSINESS PARK, Sector 17-B,<br/>Block F, South City I, Sector 41,<br/>Gurugram, Haryana 122003</p></div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-5\">Quick Links</h3><ul class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/governance\">Governance</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/news\">News and Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-[#4A4749] hover:text-[#09569a] transition-colors\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-[#1a1a1a] mb-5\">Impact V